<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>StrideShow - Present from Any Device</title>
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/strideshow-icon.png">
    <style>
        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
        body {
            font-family: "Segoe UI", Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            background: #f8f9fa;
            min-height: 100vh;
        }
        .hero {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1a2e 0%, #16213e 100%);
            color: white;
            padding: 80px 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .hero-logo {
            max-width: 350px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }
        .hero h1 {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .hero p {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            color: #aaa;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto 40px;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        .hero-buttons {
            display: flex;
            gap: 20px;
            justify-content: center;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }
        .btn {
            padding: 15px 35px;
            border-radius: 30px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
        }
        .btn:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 5px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
        }
        .btn-primary {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #00d4aa 0%, #00a085 100%);
            color: white;
        }
        .btn-secondary {
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
            color: white;
            border: 2px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.3);
        }
        .features {
            padding: 80px 20px;
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }
        .features h2 {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 2rem;
            color: #333;
            margin-bottom: 50px;
        }
        .features-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
            gap: 30px;
        }
        .feature-card {
            background: white;
            padding: 40px 30px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            box-shadow: 0 5px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
            text-align: center;
        }
        .feature-icon {
            font-size: 3rem;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .feature-card h3 {
            color: #333;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            font-size: 1.3rem;
        }
        .feature-card p {
            color: #666;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        .how-it-works {
            background: white;
            padding: 80px 20px;
        }
        .how-it-works h2 {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 2rem;
            color: #333;
            margin-bottom: 50px;
        }
        .steps {
            max-width: 900px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
            gap: 40px;
        }
        .step {
            text-align: center;
        }
        .step-number {
            width: 60px;
            height: 60px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #00d4aa 0%, #00a085 100%);
            color: white;
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin: 0 auto 20px;
        }
        .step h3 {
            color: #333;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        .step p {
            color: #666;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }
        .cta {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #00d4aa 0%, #00a085 100%);
            color: white;
            padding: 60px 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .cta h2 {
            font-size: 2rem;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .cta p {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            opacity: 0.9;
        }
        .cta .btn {
            background: white;
            color: #00a085;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <%- include('partials/navbar') %>
    
    <section class="hero">
        <img src="/strideshow-logo.png" alt="StrideShow" class="hero-logo">
        <h1>Present from Any Device</h1>
        <p>Control your presentations from your phone while displaying on any screen. No cables, no apps to install - just scan a code and present.</p>
        <div class="hero-buttons">
            <a href="/register" class="btn btn-primary">Get Started Free</a>
            <a href="/go" class="btn btn-secondary">Open Display Screen</a>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="features">
        <h2>Why StrideShow?</h2>
        <div class="features-grid">
            <div class="feature-card">
                <div class="feature-icon">📱</div>
                <h3>Control from Your Phone</h3>
                <p>Use your smartphone as a remote control. Navigate slides, view speaker notes, and manage your presentation with ease.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature-card">
                <div class="feature-icon">🖥️</div>
                <h3>Display Anywhere</h3>
                <p>Open the display on any device with a browser - TVs, projectors, laptops. No special software required.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature-card">
                <div class="feature-icon">🔗</div>
                <h3>Instant Connection</h3>
                <p>Just scan a QR code or enter a 6-digit code. Connect to any display in seconds without complex setup.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="how-it-works">
        <h2>How It Works</h2>
        <div class="steps">
            <div class="step">
                <div class="step-number">1</div>
                <h3>Open Display</h3>
                <p>Go to /go on your TV or projector browser to show the connection code.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="step">
                <div class="step-number">2</div>
                <h3>Connect</h3>
                <p>Scan the QR code or enter the code on your phone to connect as presenter.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="step">
                <div class="step-number">3</div>
                <h3>Present</h3>
                <p>Select your slideshow and control the presentation from your device!</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="cta">
        <h2>Ready to Transform Your Presentations?</h2>
        <p>Join thousands of presenters who've simplified their workflow with StrideShow.</p>
        <a href="/register" class="btn">Create Free Account</a>
    </section>

    <%- include('partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>
